{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"a86bcedb5792445e1c87209da49e199f1d08b05cb99531265f34ef7b9792b3d3","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"519f027d0c75303c0c8f8eb7dc10bd783817d9fbb171422c7a5f481040d694a4","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"fay-willows.lua L465-481 (cults, unpinned): several meaning errors. (1) L477 'Some who couldn't scramble out of our way were trampled as we ran over them' → '当我们从他们身上碾过时，许多人都无法没能逃脱'. This is garbled (double negative 无法没能), drops 'trampled', and turns 'some' into '许多人'. (2) L479 'many killed by that halfling's hands' → '其中大部分死在那个半身人的手中'. 'many' is not 'most'. (3) L477 'from snubbing the zealots' → '碾碎那些狂热者'. snub means to rebuff or humiliate, not to crush, and the zealots were not crushed. (4) L475 'we need to push through and get out of here' → '我们需要迅速离开这里'. This drops 'push through', which is the order the next paragraph carries out. 'looking ahead' → '环视四周' is also wrong."},{"revision_key":"51b2a4ec5ed5d396996d836a6376ece33f9931635aaa1a8b8404ccf1a474d8f8","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"krogs-rescue.lua L24 (cults, unpinned): 'show the evildoers the wrongness of their way. Permanently.' is an ironic order to kill the necromancers. L25-27 make killing them the quest condition ('You have killed the necromancers'). The target '并永久修正邪恶的错误' drops 'the evildoers' as the object and the 'kill them' meaning, and reads as 'correct the mistakes of evil'. 'Save our people' → '去拯救人民' also drops 'our'."},{"revision_key":"52a70d37b538c99403277589b30b57b30e7e6193c081e6fe4a635c8868ff37d6","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"52b301808442d228d7eeb39536d6ec209a8c578ced9e911794d1b786fde5fabe","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"madness.lua L157 (cults, unpinned): 'the victim will deal %d%% reduced damage to all other targets until the vision is slain' → '被影响的敌人在幻象被击杀前造成的伤害降低 %d%%'. This drops the 'to all other targets' qualifier. In the source the reduction applies to targets other than the vision, but the translation makes it an unconditional reduction to all damage, which states the mechanic too broadly."},{"revision_key":"52d427a26ac0da6eb9a5566c9ac82ce07332b992a8e0a93cc8856bfdcff2dea9","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"fay-willows.lua (cults, unpinned), several meaning errors. (1) 'I did not know who this attacker was' → '它不知道袭击者是谁'. The subject is wrong; it should be 我. (2) 'including the chaotic energies within me' → '包括我内心的黑暗能量'. chaotic is mistranslated as 黑暗. (3) 'with only my thoughts to keep my company' → '只想着我的任务'. This is a mistranslation. (4) 'We've had a few more wander in through the Shroud while you were scouting' → '我们又在帷幕里碰到了几只'. The source means undead got into the city through the Shroud, not that they were met inside the Shroud. (5) 'a shaloren soldier walked into me and knocked me to the ground' → '走近我'. This loses the collision, so being knocked down no longer makes sense. (6) 'a fury of blows that quickly overwhelmed the creature' → '狂怒的一击，很快就把它击倒了'. This conflicts with the following text, where the creature is not dead and attacks again. (7) 'had come to know him as family' → '后来和他一起组成了家庭'. This changes the relationship. (8) '我我很抱歉' has a duplicated character."},{"revision_key":"543d53338ab8a222bc167b3bd768734db13fb37382b41722201955390b4a9b7f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"557d673c0a4bfeb499d01961f330a120d77054d798030da8f78e3ac3d13df8b4","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"town-kroshkkur/npcs.lua (cults, unpinned), drem seeker of knowledge: 'minding its own business' is an idiom meaning it is doing its own thing and not bothering anyone. The target '他正在思考自己的事情' reads as 'thinking about its own affairs', which misreads the idiom. The same entry also has a female variant (L91-92 female=1), so fixing the drem as 他 is inaccurate; the source uses 'its'."},{"revision_key":"55a4ebf91524d392a533fa52b322cfc29a3d4055d812d21f47ca3be1d81c44c3","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"5621f25c255043da38bbd5f836bfc8b5b4f486d649d6a47366599df93655063a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"5839d4c867eca45230c9e507e6869ef66d53c0955342fd1038d9a15a896ddca3","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"58fe550acbee4ddb3e7ede68752c4291729f8f4353ff3abfaf47b96ceb1cb294","verdict":"OK"}]}